    {
      "id": "claim_d0340d0cfffb42bbac996d7b5130609a",
      "statement": "The system Telephony content providers (Telephony.Sms, Telephony.Mms, Telephony.Threads) are the durable source of truth: SmsReceiver persists the incoming PDU and reads the row back before any fan-out, SmsSender writes outgoing rows into Telephony.Sms.Sent because SmsManager.sendTextMessage does not persist sent messages for non-default apps, and downstream consumers (UI, gateway inbox reads, webhooks) are built from provider state rather than broadcast extras.",
      "evidence": [
