    {
      "id": "claim_d1bb29c7e3ff4ec797c4b3bc78017272",
      "statement": "SharedPreferences hold gateway/feature configuration: GatewayPreferences owns the sms_gateway_prefs store (enabled intent, runtime mirror, consent version, port, cloud/GMweb settings), and secrets such as the API key and webhook signing secret are persisted encrypted with a non-exportable AES-256-GCM key from the hardware-backed Android Keystore via SecureStore under an enc:v1: marker, so they are never plaintext at rest; the EVE send queue uses a separate eve_queue_prefs store.",
