    {
      "id": "claim_0b12c04c20a84bc3b01abda91f604ebf",
      "statement": "docs/architecture-v2-sync.md documents the refactor rationale for the data layer: the old path ran a full dual-source sync, conversation rebuild, and O(10K-rows) unread count on every incoming SMS, and the governing principle adopted is 'If you have the ID, operate on that ID. Full sync is repair, not the main path.'",
      "evidence": [
